{"id":62218,"mal_id":62218,"title":"Daxia Shou Mu Ren","englishTitle":"The Guardian of Daxia","title_english":"The Guardian of Daxia","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"The Guardian of Daxia","ja":"大夏守墓人"},"synopsis":"Ten years ago, after a blood moon lasted three days, monsters, deities, mystic eyes, and ghost stories came in succession. As the mysterious and the uncanny fall upon the human world. Horror and despair roam the land. As humans, should we kneel in submission, wail in tears, or unsheathe our blades? This is a new age, and this age belongs to the transcendent! Opening the gate to the transcendent, Su Bai beholds a new world...\n\n(Source: WeTV)","synopsis_es":"Hace diez años, después de que una luna de sangre durara tres días, se sucedieron monstruos, deidades, ojos místicos e historias de fantasmas. Mientras lo misterioso y lo siniestro caen sobre el mundo humano. El horror y la desesperación vagan por la tierra. Como humanos, ¿deberíamos arrodillarnos en señal de sumisión, llorar o desenvainar nuestras espadas? ¡Esta es una nueva era, y esta era pertenece a lo trascendente! Al abrir la puerta a lo trascendente, Su Bai contempla un mundo nuevo...\n\n(Fuente: WeTV)","type":"ONA","media_type":"ona","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":660,"average_episode_duration":660,"startDate":"2026-09-30","start_date":"2026-09-30","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"summer","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"summer"},"episodes":59,"num_episodes":59,"score":null,"mean":null,"numListUsers":507,"num_list_users":507,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":82,"name":"Urban Fantasy"}],"studios":[{"id":2059,"name":"Suoyi Technology Enabled Vision"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fImqNRUlwVCxnLxlGoNmOdglSUe.jpg","logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":"297924","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:50:23.468Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1790/